# 端到端内联提示测试夹具：每一行对应一条伪代码，改动会破坏测试
# End-to-end inlay hint fixture: one line per pseudocode case; changing it breaks the tests
# （用例见 packages/client/src/test/suite/inlayHint.test.ts）

alias a r1

alias heater d1

add a a 1

lbn r0 HASH("StructureBatteryMedium") Setting Average

s heater On r6

l r3 heater Setting

ls r4 heater 1 Charge

beq a 10 5

j 20

# 下面这条没有模板：不该出现任何提示
# No template below: it must not produce a hint
clamp r5 1 2 3
